		{"id":"75d8471754060bf1","x":-868,"y":-396,"width":506,"height":272,"type":"text","text":"| Task               | Why               | Example          | Used   |\n| ------------------ | ----------------- | ---------------- | ------ |\n| Random directions  | Need whole circle | `rand * 2π`      | Graves |\n| Particle motion    | Circular movement | `cos(θ), sin(θ)` |        |\n| Rotations          | Full turn radian  | `rotation += 2π` |        |\n| Waves              | Full waveform     | `sin(t * 2π)`    |        |\n| Procedural noise   | Periodicity       | noise functions  |        |\n| Spherical sampling | Requires 0–2π     | 3D lighting      |        |\n| Raymarching        | Rotation matrices | `cos(a), sin(a)` |        |\n"}
